1
00:00:00,035 --> 00:00:04,784
Why does every GTA, even GTA 6,
have you running from the cops?

2
00:00:04,785 --> 00:00:09,184
Because back in 1995,
a game about chasing criminals broke.

3
00:00:09,185 --> 00:00:10,789
And that bug saved it.

4
00:00:10,790 --> 00:00:11,499
Here's how.

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,204
It's 1995 in Dundee, Scotland.

6
00:00:14,205 --> 00:00:17,959
DMA Design, the studio behind
Lemmings, starts a new game.

7
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:21,534
It's called Race'n'Chase,
and it's planned to take eighteen months.

8
00:00:21,535 --> 00:00:24,469
In it, you play a police
officer chasing criminals.

9
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:26,499
But there's a problem: it's dull.

10
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:30,004
One developer later calls
it “awful… too sim-y.”

11
00:00:30,005 --> 00:00:33,160
So the people above the team
keep trying to shut it down.

12
00:00:33,205 --> 00:00:35,270
Then, something breaks.

13
00:00:35,315 --> 00:00:37,156
The police cars stop following you and

14
00:00:37,157 --> 00:00:39,529
start trying to drive
straight through you.

15
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:40,344
They ram.

16
00:00:40,345 --> 00:00:41,239
They chase.

17
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,469
They don't let go.

18
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:44,379
And suddenly, it's fun.

19
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:46,474
So the team flips the whole game.

20
00:00:46,475 --> 00:00:47,814
You're not the cop anymore.

21
00:00:47,815 --> 00:00:49,774
Now you're the one being chased.

22
00:00:49,775 --> 00:00:52,564
Of course, the eighteen
months turn into thirty.

23
00:00:52,565 --> 00:00:58,435
Until finally, in November 1997, it
ships with a new name: Grand Theft Auto.

24
00:00:59,670 --> 00:01:02,869
And every GTA since is
built around that chase.

25
00:01:02,870 --> 00:01:04,114
The wanted stars.

26
00:01:04,115 --> 00:01:05,074
The sirens.

27
00:01:05,075 --> 00:01:05,934
The running.

28
00:01:05,935 --> 00:01:06,819
Don't believe me?

29
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:09,254
Open GTA Online and buy an arcade.

30
00:01:09,255 --> 00:01:11,879
One of the machines is
called Race and Chase.

31
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:13,649
So that's why you're always running.

32
00:01:13,650 --> 00:01:15,894
The whole series started with a bug.

33
00:01:15,895 --> 00:01:17,149
And GTA 6?

34
00:01:17,150 --> 00:01:19,299
It opens with Lucia already caught.

35
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:21,268
So who's chasing who now?
